# Firebase web config, read by Vite at BUILD time and baked into the client
# bundle. These are not secrets -- Firebase web config is designed to be
# public, and access is controlled by Firestore security rules, not by hiding
# these values. Committed so Cloud Build has them when it runs `vite build`.
#
# The genuinely secret value (GEMINI_API_KEY) is NOT here -- it's set as a
# runtime env var on Cloud Run and never committed.
